---
// Diagram version: the exam guide's own example, an order lookup that returns 40 fields when the
// agent needs 5. Both loops share one scale so the reader sees the saving as the gap between the two
// triangles instead of toggling between them: same loop, same tokens per field, only the result size
// changes.
import Figure from "./kit/Figure.astro";
import Stat from "./kit/Stat.astro";
import Source from "./kit/Source.astro";
import { simulate } from "@/lib/sim/agent-loop";
import { BASE_WORKLOAD } from "./workloads";
import { fmtChange, fmtTokens } from "./format";
import { getLangFromUrl } from "../../../i18n/utils";

const FIELDS_FULL = 40;
const FIELDS_TRIMMED = 5;
const tokensPerField = BASE_WORKLOAD.toolResultTokens / FIELDS_FULL;

const runs = {
  full: simulate({ ...BASE_WORKLOAD, toolResultTokens: FIELDS_FULL * tokensPerField }),
  trimmed: simulate({ ...BASE_WORKLOAD, toolResultTokens: FIELDS_TRIMMED * tokensPerField }),
};

const N = BASE_WORKLOAD.turns;
const top = Math.max(...runs.full.requests.map((r) => r.contextTokens));

const full = { last: runs.full.requests[N - 1], total: runs.full.totals.inputTokens };
const trimmed = { last: runs.trimmed.requests[N - 1], total: runs.trimmed.totals.inputTokens };

const fullPerTurn = BASE_WORKLOAD.assistantTokens + FIELDS_FULL * tokensPerField;
const trimmedPerTurn = BASE_WORKLOAD.assistantTokens + FIELDS_TRIMMED * tokensPerField;

const columns = runs.full.requests.map((r, i) => ({
  full: (r.contextTokens / top) * 100,
  trimmed: (runs.trimmed.requests[i].contextTokens / top) * 100,
}));
const isSpanish = getLangFromUrl(Astro.url) === "es";
---

<Figure question={isSpanish ? "¿Qué ahorro produce recortar un resultado de herramienta?" : "What does trimming one tool result save?"} basis="calculated">
  <Stat
    value={fmtChange(trimmed.total, full.total)}
    delta={`${fmtTokens(full.total)} → ${fmtTokens(trimmed.total)} ${isSpanish ? "tokens de entrada" : "input tokens"}`}
    tone="gain"
  >
    {isSpanish ? (
      <>
        Cada consulta de 40 campos agrega <strong>{fmtTokens(fullPerTurn - BASE_WORKLOAD.assistantTokens)}</strong> al
        historial; con 5 campos agrega <strong>{fmtTokens(trimmedPerTurn - BASE_WORKLOAD.assistantTokens)}</strong>.
        La última de {N} solicitudes envía <strong>{fmtTokens(full.last.contextTokens)}</strong> tokens, o{" "}
        <strong>{fmtTokens(trimmed.last.contextTokens)}</strong> con el resultado recortado.
      </>
    ) : null}
    {!isSpanish && (
      <>
    Each 40-field lookup adds <strong>{fmtTokens(fullPerTurn - BASE_WORKLOAD.assistantTokens)}</strong> to the
    history; trimmed to 5 fields it's <strong>{fmtTokens(trimmedPerTurn - BASE_WORKLOAD.assistantTokens)}</strong>.
    The last of {N} requests sends <strong>{fmtTokens(full.last.contextTokens)}</strong> tokens, or{" "}
    <strong>{fmtTokens(trimmed.last.contextTokens)}</strong> trimmed.
      </>
    )}
  </Stat>

  <div class="tc-row">
    <div class="tc-chart" aria-hidden="true">
      {
        columns.map((c) => (
          <span class="tc-col">
            <span class="tc-bar tc-bar-full" style={`height: ${c.full.toFixed(2)}%`} />
            <span class="tc-bar tc-bar-trim" style={`height: ${c.trimmed.toFixed(2)}%`} />
          </span>
        ))
      }
    </div>
    <div class="tc-last" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="tc-last-value full">{fmtTokens(full.last.contextTokens)}</span>
      <span class="tc-last-value trim">{fmtTokens(trimmed.last.contextTokens)}</span>
      <span class="tc-last-label">{isSpanish ? "última solicitud" : "last request"}</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="tc-axis" aria-hidden="true">
    <span>{isSpanish ? "solicitud 1" : "request 1"}</span>
    <span>{isSpanish ? "solicitud" : "request"} {N}</span>
  </div>

  <p class="sr-only">
    {isSpanish
      ? `40 campos por resultado de herramienta: la última de ${N} solicitudes envía ${fmtTokens(full.last.contextTokens)} tokens, y el bucle envía ${fmtTokens(full.total)} tokens de entrada en total.`
      : `40 fields per tool result: the last of ${N} requests sends ${fmtTokens(full.last.contextTokens)} tokens, and the loop sends ${fmtTokens(full.total)} input tokens in total.`}
  </p>
  <p class="sr-only">
    {isSpanish
      ? `Recortado a 5 campos: la última de ${N} solicitudes envía ${fmtTokens(trimmed.last.contextTokens)} tokens, y el bucle envía ${fmtTokens(trimmed.total)} tokens de entrada en total.`
      : `Trimmed to 5 fields: the last of ${N} requests sends ${fmtTokens(trimmed.last.contextTokens)} tokens, and the loop sends ${fmtTokens(trimmed.total)} input tokens in total.`}
  </p>

  <ul class="alc-legend" aria-hidden="true">
    <li><span class="tc-swatch full" />{FIELDS_FULL} {isSpanish ? "campos, total" : "fields, total"} {fmtTokens(full.total)}</li>
    <li><span class="tc-swatch trim" />{FIELDS_TRIMMED} {isSpanish ? "campos, total" : "fields, total"} {fmtTokens(trimmed.total)}</li>
    <li class="tc-note">{isSpanish ? "el espacio es el ahorro" : "the gap is the saving"}: {fmtChange(trimmed.total, full.total)}</li>
  </ul>

  <Source slot="caption">
    {isSpanish ? (
      `La consulta de pedido de 40 campos es el ejemplo de la guía del examen sobre un resultado de herramienta que se acumula en el contexto. Supuesto: cada campo tiene el mismo tamaño, ${fmtTokens(tokensPerField)} tokens. El mismo bucle, con ${N} solicitudes cada uno: ${fmtTokens(trimmed.total)} frente a ${fmtTokens(full.total)} tokens de entrada.`
    ) : null}
    {!isSpanish && (
      <>
    The 40-field order lookup is the exam guide's own example of a tool result that piles up in context. Assumption:
    every field is the same size, {fmtTokens(tokensPerField)} tokens. Same loop, {N} requests each:{" "}
    {fmtTokens(trimmed.total)} against {fmtTokens(full.total)} input tokens.
      </>
    )}
  </Source>
</Figure>

<style>
  .tc-row {
    --tc-label-w: 4.5rem;
    --tc-h: 160px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr var(--tc-label-w);
    align-items: end;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .tc-chart {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    gap: 2px;
    height: var(--tc-h);
    border-bottom: 1px solid hsl(var(--border));
  }
  .tc-col {
    position: relative;
    flex: 1 1 0;
    min-width: 0;
    height: 100%;
  }
  .tc-bar {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    border-radius: 1px 1px 0 0;
  }
  .tc-bar-full {
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--alc-bad) 45%, transparent);
  }
  .tc-bar-trim {
    left: 25%;
    right: 25%;
    background: var(--alc-good);
  }

  .tc-last {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-end;
    gap: 2px;
    padding-bottom: 2px;
    font-family: var(--font-family-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-meta);
    line-height: var(--text-meta--line-height);
  }
  .tc-last-value {
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .tc-last-value.full {
    color: var(--alc-bad);
  }
  .tc-last-value.trim {
    color: var(--alc-good);
  }
  .tc-last-label {
    color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground));
  }

  .tc-axis {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin: 4px 0 0;
    padding-right: calc(var(--tc-label-w) + 12px);
    font-family: var(--font-family-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-meta);
    line-height: var(--text-meta--line-height);
    color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground));
  }

  .tc-swatch {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    margin-right: 6px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    vertical-align: -1px;
  }
  .tc-swatch.full {
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--alc-bad) 45%, transparent);
  }
  .tc-swatch.trim {
    background: var(--alc-good);
  }
  .tc-note {
    color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground));
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .tc-row {
      --tc-h: 120px;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      grid-template-areas: "chart" "last";
      row-gap: 6px;
    }
    .tc-chart {
      grid-area: chart;
    }
    .tc-last {
      grid-area: last;
      flex-direction: row;
      justify-content: flex-end;
      gap: 10px;
    }
    .tc-last-label {
      display: none;
    }
    .tc-axis {
      padding-right: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
